# ==============================================================================
# MediBridge Root Environment Reference
# ==============================================================================
# MediBridge maintains strictly independent environments for backend and frontend.
# Server secrets must never be mixed with client configuration.
#
# Please configure your local environments using the respective templates:
#
# 1. Backend Server Configuration:
#    See backend/.env.example -> copy to backend/.env
#    (Database URIs, JWT secrets, AES-256 keys, AI API keys, storage settings)
#
# 2. Frontend Client Configuration:
#    See frontend/.env.example -> copy to frontend/.env
#    (Vite client variables: VITE_API_URL, VITE_APP_NAME)
#
# ==============================================================================
